#. type: Title #
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using Yii with RoadRunner"
msgstr "Usando o Yii com RoadRunner"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[RoadRunner](https://roadrunner.dev/) is a Golang-powered application server that integrates well with PHP. It runs\n"
"it as workers and each worker may handle multiple requests. Such an operation mode is often called\n"
"[event loop](using-with-event-loop.md) and allows not re-initializing a framework for each request that improves\n"
"performance significantly.\n"
msgstr ""
"O [RoadRunner](https://roadrunner.dev/) é um servidor de aplicação escrito em Go que se integra bem ao PHP. Ele roda\n"
"o PHP como workers, e cada worker pode atender várias requisições. Esse modo de operação costuma ser chamado de\n"
"[event loop](using-with-event-loop.md) e evita reinicializar o framework a cada requisição, o que melhora\n"
"bastante o desempenho.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "RoadRunner works on Linux, macOS and Windows. The best way to install it is to use a Composer:"
msgstr "O RoadRunner funciona no Linux, macOS e Windows. A melhor forma de instalá-lo é pelo Composer:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "composer require yiisoft/yii-runner-roadrunner\n"
msgstr "composer require yiisoft/yii-runner-roadrunner\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "After installation is done, run"
msgstr "Terminada a instalação, execute"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "./vendor/bin/rr get\n"
msgstr "./vendor/bin/rr get\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "That would download ready to use RoadRunner server `rr` binary."
msgstr "Isso baixa o binário `rr` do servidor RoadRunner, pronto para uso."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "First, we need to configure the server itself. Create `/.rr.yaml` and add the following config:"
msgstr "Primeiro, precisamos configurar o próprio servidor. Crie `/.rr.yaml` e adicione a seguinte configuração:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"version: '3'\n"
"\n"
"server:\n"
"  command: \"php worker.php\"\n"
"\n"
"rpc:\n"
"  listen: tcp://127.0.0.1:6001\n"
"\n"
"http:\n"
"  address: :8080\n"
"  pool:\n"
"    debug: false # set to true for local development only\n"
"    supervisor:\n"
"      max_worker_memory: 192\n"
"  middleware: [static, gzip, headers, sendfile]\n"
"  static:\n"
"    dir:   \"public\"\n"
"    forbid: [\".php\", \".htaccess\"]\n"
"  headers:\n"
"    response:\n"
"      \"Cache-Control\": \"no-cache\"\n"
"\n"
"logs:\n"
"  mode: production\n"
"  level: warn\n"
msgstr ""
"version: '3'\n"
"\n"
"server:\n"
"  command: \"php worker.php\"\n"
"\n"
"rpc:\n"
"  listen: tcp://127.0.0.1:6001\n"
"\n"
"http:\n"
"  address: :8080\n"
"  pool:\n"
"    debug: false # defina como true apenas no desenvolvimento local\n"
"    supervisor:\n"
"      max_worker_memory: 192\n"
"  middleware: [static, gzip, headers, sendfile]\n"
"  static:\n"
"    dir:   \"public\"\n"
"    forbid: [\".php\", \".htaccess\"]\n"
"  headers:\n"
"    response:\n"
"      \"Cache-Control\": \"no-cache\"\n"
"\n"
"logs:\n"
"  mode: production\n"
"  level: warn\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!INFO]\n"
"> Read more about TLS, HTTP/2, HTTP/3 configuration and other middleware [on the RoadRunner docs](https://docs.roadrunner.dev/docs/http/http).\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!INFO]\n"
"> Saiba mais sobre configuração de TLS, HTTP/2, HTTP/3 e outros middlewares [na documentação do RoadRunner](https://docs.roadrunner.dev/docs/http/http).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "We're specifying that the entry script is `worker.php`, the server listens on port 8080, `public` directory files are served statically except `.php` and `.htaccess`. The `max_worker_memory` is a soft limit: if a worker exceeds 192 MB, it will restart after finishing its current request. Also, we're sending an additional header."
msgstr "Estamos definindo que o script de entrada é o `worker.php`, que o servidor escuta na porta 8080 e que os arquivos do diretório `public` são servidos estaticamente, exceto `.php` e `.htaccess`. O `max_worker_memory` é um limite flexível: se um worker passar de 192 MB, ele reinicia depois de terminar a requisição atual. Também estamos enviando um header adicional."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "KV cache"
msgstr "Cache KV"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "RoadRunner has a [KV plugin](https://docs.roadrunner.dev/docs/key-value/overview-kv) that can be used as a PSR-16 cache storage. It is useful when the application already runs under RoadRunner and needs a cache shared by workers."
msgstr "O RoadRunner tem um [plugin KV](https://docs.roadrunner.dev/docs/key-value/overview-kv) que pode ser usado como armazenamento de cache PSR-16. Ele é útil quando a aplicação já roda no RoadRunner e precisa de um cache compartilhado entre os workers."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "Install the PHP bridge and Yii cache package:"
msgstr "Instale a ponte PHP e o pacote de cache do Yii:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "composer require spiral/roadrunner-kv yiisoft/cache\n"
msgstr "composer require spiral/roadrunner-kv yiisoft/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "Add a KV storage to `.rr.yaml`:"
msgstr "Adicione um armazenamento KV ao `.rr.yaml`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"kv:\n"
"  cache:\n"
"    driver: memory\n"
"    config:\n"
"      interval: 60\n"
msgstr ""
"kv:\n"
"  cache:\n"
"    driver: memory\n"
"    config:\n"
"      interval: 60\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "The `memory` driver stores values inside the RoadRunner process, so its data is lost when RoadRunner stops.  For persistent cache storage, use another KV driver from the RoadRunner documentation."
msgstr "O driver `memory` guarda os valores dentro do processo do RoadRunner, então os dados se perdem quando o RoadRunner para.  Para um armazenamento de cache persistente, use outro driver KV da documentação do RoadRunner."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "Create `config/common/di/roadrunner-kv.php`:"
msgstr "Crie `config/common/di/roadrunner-kv.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\SimpleCache\\CacheInterface as SimpleCacheInterface;\n"
"use Spiral\\Goridge\\RPC\\RPC;\n"
"use Spiral\\RoadRunner\\KeyValue\\Factory;\n"
"use Spiral\\RoadRunner\\KeyValue\\StorageInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\Cache;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\CacheInterface as YiiCacheInterface;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    StorageInterface::class => static function (): StorageInterface {\n"
"        $factory = new Factory(RPC::create('tcp://127.0.0.1:6001'));\n"
"\n"
"        return $factory->select('cache');\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    SimpleCacheInterface::class => StorageInterface::class,\n"
"    YiiCacheInterface::class => Cache::class,\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\SimpleCache\\CacheInterface as SimpleCacheInterface;\n"
"use Spiral\\Goridge\\RPC\\RPC;\n"
"use Spiral\\RoadRunner\\KeyValue\\Factory;\n"
"use Spiral\\RoadRunner\\KeyValue\\StorageInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\Cache;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\CacheInterface as YiiCacheInterface;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    StorageInterface::class => static function (): StorageInterface {\n"
"        $factory = new Factory(RPC::create('tcp://127.0.0.1:6001'));\n"
"\n"
"        return $factory->select('cache');\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    SimpleCacheInterface::class => StorageInterface::class,\n"
"    YiiCacheInterface::class => Cache::class,\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "Now services can use `Yiisoft\\Cache\\CacheInterface` the same way as with other cache backends:"
msgstr "Agora os serviços podem usar `Yiisoft\\Cache\\CacheInterface` do mesmo jeito que com outros backends de cache:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\CacheInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class FeedService\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private CacheInterface $cache,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function latest(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->cache->getOrSet('feed-latest', fn (): array => $this->loadLatest(), 60);\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    private function loadLatest(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\CacheInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class FeedService\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private CacheInterface $cache,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function latest(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->cache->getOrSet('feed-latest', fn (): array => $this->loadLatest(), 60);\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    private function loadLatest(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "Create `/worker.php`:"
msgstr "Crie `/worker.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Environment;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\Runner\\RoadRunner\\RoadRunnerHttpApplicationRunner;\n"
"\n"
"ini_set('display_errors', 'stderr');\n"
"\n"
"require_once __DIR__ . '/src/bootstrap.php';\n"
"\n"
"(new RoadRunnerHttpApplicationRunner(\n"
"    rootPath: __DIR__, \n"
"    debug: Environment::appDebug(),\n"
"    checkEvents: Environment::appDebug(),\n"
"    environment: Environment::appEnv()\n"
"))->run();\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Environment;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\Runner\\RoadRunner\\RoadRunnerHttpApplicationRunner;\n"
"\n"
"ini_set('display_errors', 'stderr');\n"
"\n"
"require_once __DIR__ . '/src/bootstrap.php';\n"
"\n"
"(new RoadRunnerHttpApplicationRunner(\n"
"    rootPath: __DIR__, \n"
"    debug: Environment::appDebug(),\n"
"    checkEvents: Environment::appDebug(),\n"
"    environment: Environment::appEnv()\n"
"))->run();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-swoole.md
msgid "To start a server, execute the following command:"
msgstr "Para iniciar o servidor, execute o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "./rr serve\n"
msgstr "./rr serve\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "Each worker's scope is isolated from other workers. Memory isn't shared."
msgstr "O escopo de cada worker é isolado dos outros workers. A memória não é compartilhada."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "A single worker serves multiple requests where the scope is shared."
msgstr "Um único worker atende várias requisições, e nelas o escopo é compartilhado."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
msgid "At each iteration of the event loop, every service that depends on state should be reset."
msgstr "A cada iteração do event loop, todo serviço que depende de estado deve ser redefinido."
